 was severed from her ear  so clearly some serious damage has been  done to jiro i'm not sure if the jack  will now be gone forever or if her  mutation type quirk can regrow it but  either way she does still have one jack  on her other ear and this has to be said  despite being injured giro does not  fault her in the slightest she says that  she doesn't give a damn about all for  one saying that she's weak and an extra  because none of that matters to her all  she knows is that all for one made her  friends cry  and with fury and passion in her eyes  she launches an attack called heartbeat  wall legato from her remaining jack  right at all for one all for one doesn't  seem too affected by this sonic blast at  first and he claims that all those  factors that shonen characters use to  hype themselves up including motivation  and spirit and ability are useless in  the face of his absolute power all for  one then advances on jiro pushing  directly through her sonic wave attack  and he looks fully prepared to kill her  but before he can reach her something  stops him all for one suddenly realizes  that there is something wrong on the  inside the wills of all of the people  whose quirks he has stolen have risen up  inside of him and they are trying to  stop him from killing jiro all for one  believes that new order might have  somehow triggered this reaction and he  is surprised that the will of such  weaklings is actually having an effect  on him and the attack from jiro combined  with the unexpected interruption from  the inside of his own body expose all  for one to a surprise attack by hawks  hawks has already managed to create a  slight crack in all for one's mask by  hitting the same exact location multiple  times and we can assume that jiro's  attack also helped make the crack worse  hawks then goes in for the kill slicing  at the same exact spot once again with  his sword hawks hits the crack so hard  that his blade shatters and then finally  we see that all for o